  <section>
    <h2>Research use only</h2>
    <p>Scrooner provides informational tools and is not an investment adviser, broker, or fiduciary. Nothing in the product is personalized investment, legal, tax, or accounting advice.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Verify before relying</h2>
    <p>Public filings can be amended, structured data can contain reporting inconsistencies, and derived metrics can be incomplete or incorrect. Verify material facts against original disclosures and use independent judgment.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Do not misuse, disrupt, probe, or overload the service; bypass access controls; or use the product in violation of applicable law or third-party rights. Beta availability may be changed or withdrawn.</p>
    <p class="public-meta">Last updated: 28 August 2026</p>
  </section>
</PublicPageLayout>
